<title>NETHERLANDS: Generale Bank rates Ahrend a Buy.</title>
<headline>Generale Bank rates Ahrend a Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Aug 23 research.</p>
<p>    Company-----Sector------------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    Ahrend	office furniture  80.20   Generale Bank</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (reiterated) - Price target 90 guilders. Premium of 10 pct to Dutch market justified rather than discount. Profit growth seen of 21 pct in 1996 despite very small loss in Germany. Ahrend aims to buy German distribution company at bottom of cycle -- excellent timing. Good brand name allows international marketing, strong position in Netherlands.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	4.43		  18.1    1.55</p>
<p>    1996		   5.40     5.45     14.9    1.85</p>
<p>    1997		   6.25     same     12.8    2.10</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
